						],
						"pointId": 311
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790750301,
					"content": "Phew... The wind's finally stopped...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750302,
						790750303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750302,
					"content": "Listen to us, please.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750304,
					"content": "Fine. I'll listen to what you have to say. But before that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750305,
					"content": "Look how shocked the two of you are! I'm sure you're dying to ask, \"How can a flower speak?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750306,
					"content": "Or perhaps, \"How did you turn into a potted flower?\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750307,
					"content": "Do people usually ask that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750308,
					"content": "Outside, yes, many. After I returned home... No, nobody has asked.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750309,
					"content": "By \"outside,\" do you mean outside this world?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750310,
					"content": "I've heard that you only became like this after venturing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750311,
					"content": "Well well, look who's so well-informed! I suppose Panuelle must have told you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750312,
					"content": "That's correct. I became like this while I was venturing. Hehe, to borrow a phrase from that Rozel... This was the \"change\" I chose to make.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750313,
					"content": "Paimon gets change... But why change into a potted flower?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750314,
						790750315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750314,
					"content": "Could it be because you really, really like plants?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750316,
					"content": "No. I just... wanted to find my \"place.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750317,
					"content": "I met many people outside this world. Some were chefs, others florists, others teachers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750318,
					"content": "Almost everyone had found a \"place\" that made them feel at ease. That was how they'd all managed to establish themselves in life.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750319,
					"content": "And me? All I could do was venture. I had never thought of finding a stable \"place\" for myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750320,
					"content": "This \"flower pot\" is your \"place.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750321,
					"content": "Exactly. You catch on quick.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750322,
					"content": "As a flower in a pot, I'll always have a \"place\" that puts me at ease.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750323,
					"content": "But... *sigh* Since I've already got myself a pot, and a \"place\" that belongs to me, why do I still want to go out venturing?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750324,
					"content": "I'm a venturer, after all. Without venturing, is there anything else of value I can do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750325,
					"content": "I don't get it. The more of the outside world I see, the less I understand... Between having a \"place\" and \"venturing,\" which is more important?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750326,
					"content": "The more I think about it, the more my head hurts... And when I talk with Panuelle, I always duck his questions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750327,
					"content": "I'm afraid of misleading him. If he loved venturing, would he grow to hate it after seeing me like this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750328,
					"content": "He is my friend, and always will be. I must be honest with him, and I have answered all that he has asked.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750329,
					"content": "Including... That the reason I became a flower is so I could have a \"place\" that made me feel at ease.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750330
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750330,
					"content": "Perhaps my answer upset him... Or perhaps, it's because he doesn't like the way I am now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750331,
					"content": "We are growing apart, but as I am but a potted plant, I cannot go up myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750332,
					"content": "But it's probably for the best, I'm sure Panuelle doesn't want to see me anyway. He must be angry with me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750333,
					"content": "Oh... So that's what's going on! You both think the other one's angry with you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750334,
					"content": "And so they aren't willing to meet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750335
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750335,
					"content": "What? Y—You mean, Panuelle isn't mad at me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750336,
						790750337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750336,
					"content": "You two are thinking the exact same thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750338
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750338,
					"content": "You tell Chauvigne all about everything Panuelle is thinking...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750339
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750339,
					"content": "Skies above, how could I ever think such a thing? I have never wanted to see him upset, and even should the corners of his lips twitch downward, my heart would be utterly shattered!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750340,
					"content": "Dear guests! I must ask you to bring me up, I beg it of you! I must see him with all haste! I cannot wait another minute, no, not even another second!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chauvigne"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750341,
					"content": "I was waiting for you to say that, my potted friend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750342,
					"content": "#Hehe, Paimon was waiting for it too! Off we go, {NICKNAME}!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 790750337,
					"content": "He actually thinks you're the one who's angry at him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750338
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790750315,
					"content": "Your dream is to become a botanist?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790750316
					]
